Modifications by MAX Patcher
----------------------------

MAX Patcher is a modified version of the Program, identified and marked as different from the
original in the following ways, as GPLv3 Section 7c requires:

- The application name is MAX Patcher, not Morphe.
- The application id is app.maxpatcher.manager, which installs separately from the original.
- The launcher icon, splash mark, notification icons and wordmark are original MAX artwork.
  The upstream branding assets are not covered by the upstream open-source licence and none of
  them are redistributed here.
- The patcher engine is a fork, maintained in this repository at `engine/` as MAX Engine, built
  from source instead of downloaded from the Morphe GitHub Packages registry. Its own NOTICE lists
  what it changes.
- The default patch source is MAX Patches, a separate project, not Morphe Patches.
- The accent colours differ from the upstream palette.
- The package names, class names and internal architecture are unchanged, so that upstream
  features, patches and patch bundles keep working. A different package name is not what
  Section 7c asks for, and changing it would break every patch API for no user-visible gain.

